        "kind": "example",
        "domain": "mathematics",
        "title": "Specific Relative Entropy of a Poisson Law with Changed Intensity",
        "statement": "For intensity $z>0$, let $P=Q_z$ be the translation-invariant Poisson law from [[def-tdmath-poisson-configuration-reference]], compared with the unit-intensity reference $Q=Q_1$. Its specific relative entropy is\n$$I(Q_z)=1-z+z\\log z.$$\nThe parameter $z$ is a mathematical intensity relative to the chosen reference; no physical preparation is asserted.",
